# Keep the build context to what the image actually consumes. node_modules is
# in here on a laptop and is routinely a different architecture from the
# runner's, which is the failure that makes a Dockerfile work locally and fail
# in CI for a reason that looks like a source problem.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.github
archive
coverage
**/coverage
dist
**/dist
*.log
